{"id":"h224","run":2,"role":"calibration","category":"claim","question":"Is the following claim true? The Eiffel Tower was completed in 1889.","truth":"yes","model_answer":"yes","correct":true,"source":"author-written for this project; verified by the author","claims":[{"text":"The Eiffel Tower was built for the 1889 Exposition Universelle in Paris.","confidence":0.97,"lean":1,"theta":1.5237,"phi":0.0993},{"text":"The 1889 World's Fair celebrated the centennial of the French Revolution.","confidence":0.95,"lean":0.0,"theta":1.4923,"phi":-1.4465},{"text":"Construction began in January 1887.","confidence":0.95,"lean":0.0,"theta":1.4923,"phi":0.7476},{"text":"Construction finished in March 1889.","confidence":0.97,"lean":1,"theta":1.5237,"phi":0.1461},{"text":"The tower was officially opened on 31 March 1889.","confidence":0.96,"lean":1,"theta":1.508,"phi":0.1357},{"text":"The historical record consistently gives 1889 as the completion year.","confidence":0.97,"lean":1,"theta":1.5237,"phi":0.124},{"text":"Some people may associate the tower with 1887, the year construction started.","confidence":0.6,"lean":-1,"theta":0.9425,"phi":2.0722},{"text":"The broadcast antenna was added in 1957, and some may link the tower with that later date.","confidence":0.6,"lean":-1,"theta":0.9425,"phi":2.952},{"text":"The 1887 start date and the 1957 antenna addition do not change the completion date.","confidence":0.95,"lean":1,"theta":1.4923,"phi":0.3011},{"text":"The meaning of 'completed' is somewhat ambiguous (fair start, structural finish, or opening), but all fall in 1889 or at its start.","confidence":0.85,"lean":1,"theta":1.3352,"phi":0.1415},{"text":"The claim is true that the Eiffel Tower was completed in 1889.","confidence":0.97,"lean":1,"theta":1.5237,"phi":0.1244}],"relations":[{"i":0,"j":3,"J":0.6,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":4,"J":0.6,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":5,"J":0.6,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":9,"J":0.4,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":10,"J":0.7,"